SafeSABR
Copyright 2026 SafeSABR authors

This repository contains the SafeSABR research code for risk-calibrated
adaptive bitrate streaming over Starlink traces.

Some ABR simulator and training components are adapted from or inspired by
open-source ABR research codebases, especially:

- Comyco-Lin: https://github.com/godka/comyco-lin
- Pensieve Retrain: https://github.com/GreenLv/pensieve_retrain

SafeSABR keeps the simulator lineage visible in source comments and uses these
components as the ABR simulation substrate for the SafeSABR method.

StarNet data are not redistributed in this repository. Users should obtain
StarNet from the official repository:
https://github.com/ConnectedSystemsLab/StarNet
